<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 1-4.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 1-4.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set the following  exchange rates for August 1-4. The kroon is pegged at eight kroons  to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     August 1-4    July 30/August 1</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42689	  0.42621</p>
<p>    DKK    2.1		2.09992</p>
<p>    FIM    2.67984	  2.69136</p>
<p>    GBP   24.21853	 24.03414</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07487	  0.07477</p>
<p>    LTL    3.68882	  3.66519</p>
<p>    LVL   25.20864	 25.08948</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00254	    0.00252</p>
<p>    SEK    1.84692	  1.84688</p>
<p>    UAH    7.94937	  7.89959</p>
<p>    USD   14.7584	  14.6648</p>
<p>    XEU   15.79075	 15.77419</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
